        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Garth Ennis, Jacen Burrows, Steve Dillon\n- Companies: Avatar Press, Marvel Comics, Vertigo\n- Works: Crossed, Preacher, Punisher\n\nFacts:\n- Garth Ennis was born on 16 January 1970 and is a Northern Irish-born naturalized American comics writer.\n- Garth Ennis is best known for the Vertigo series Preacher with artist Steve Dillon.\n- Garth Ennis is also known for a successful nine-year run on Marvel Comics' Punisher franchise.\n- Crossed is a comic book written by Garth Ennis.\n- Jacen Burrows drew the first ten issues of Crossed.\n- Avatar Press published Crossed.",
